.scratch/

# Scratch files from exploratory runs -- probes, repros, one-off scripts. They belong in a
# temp dir, but an agent or a hurried session drops one in the root now and then, and `git add
# -A` then sweeps it into a commit. Ignored so that cannot happen silently.
__probe*
probe*.ts
_*probe*
repro.ts
**/__tmp_*
